WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.638 --> 00:00:15.598
What do you think you're doing, boy?

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:17.517
The girl's life is now mine.

00:00:19.310 --> 00:00:21.479
I'm sure she'll make
a lovely wife for you.

00:00:21.938 --> 00:00:25.066
There's a demon inside of you.
It's inside both of you.

00:00:30.989 --> 00:00:32.073
Look, everyone!

00:00:32.449 --> 00:00:35.660
This is what hatred looks like. This is
what it does when it catches hold of you.

00:00:36.077 --> 00:00:38.538
It's eating me alive,
and very soon now it will kill me!

00:00:39.706 --> 00:00:41.541
Fear and anger
only make it grow faster.

00:00:42.333 --> 00:00:44.627
I'm getting a little bored
of this curse of yours, Ashitaka.

00:00:44.711 --> 00:00:46.421
Let me just cut the damn thing off!

00:00:51.968 --> 00:00:53.136
Lady Eboshi!

00:00:55.889 --> 00:00:57.640
Someone come here
and take her from me.

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:01.686
Milady!

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:06.483
Don't worry. She's just stunned.
She'll be all right.

00:01:11.529 --> 00:01:13.573
As for me, I'm leaving,
and I'm taking the Wolf Girl!

00:01:14.407 --> 00:01:17.577
No, you're not!
Nobody treats my Lady Eboshi like that!

00:01:20.747 --> 00:01:21.956
Move and I fire!

